      <h2>2. Software and Architecture</h2>
      <p>Hop provides delay-tolerant mesh networking software and services under a hybrid model:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Client Libraries &amp; Protocol Core:</strong> The protocol implementation (`hop-core`), language SDKs, drivers, and local bearers are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. You may embed, run, and distribute them subject to that license with no requirement to use our Hosted Services.</li>
